oe  bay sea vegetables and a sauce made from  mussel stock sour cream and gooseberries  and finally the anvil rogan's signature  dessert  caramel mousse flavored with homemade  miso  sprayed with bronze and sitting in a bed  of caramelized apples  oh my goodness  wow  layers again  oh boy delicious  since opening lancloom in 2001 simon  rogan has expanded there's now a chef's  tasting room next door plus his one  michelin star casual location down the  street he's also opened a spot in london  and two in hong kong  he has his eyes on new york city next  if history is any guide america is in  for something exquisite i mean it's been  a been an amazing journey  and i've got an amazing team around me  that enabled me to look at new projects  and  see the world a bit more which is what  being a chef's all about is getting out  there experience in the world and  spirits in different cultures  cheers  cheers  i think the most elaborate and  technically precise meal i've ever seen  yes it looks prepared the amount of work  that goes into each one of those small  little tastes right  um we don't have any of these of course  18 dishes here because it was weeks ago  so you're taking us overseas and it's  across the pond so i'm going to take  both of you  to england and we'll go to london  together or thomas's promises jeff  you've been making a lot of those what  do you mean  when he opens in new york there it is

